Comment:
 retrobox-mangohud is MangoHud built with the patches shipped in
 /usr/share/doc/retrobox-mangohud/patches/. MangoHud statically links several
 libraries (imgui, implot, spdlog, Vulkan headers and utility libraries) and
 embeds some third-party code and fonts; they are described below.
 .
 The verbatim licence files and notices of upstream and of its bundled
 components are in /usr/share/doc/retrobox-mangohud/licenses/. Libraries the
 program only loads dynamically (libwayland, libxkbcommon, libX11, libdbus,
 libvulkan, ...) are not part of this package.
 .
 Paths below are paths in the upstream source tree.

